- The value must contain {StartTime} or {EscapedStartTime} and {EndTime} or {EscapedEndTime}.', example='record/{AppName}/{StreamName}/{Sequence}_{EscapedStartTime}_{EscapedEndTime}'),
      sliceDuration?: int32(name='SliceDuration', description='The segment length of a single segment. Unit: seconds.

>Notice: This parameter takes effect only when RecordFormat.N.Format is set to m3u8 or cmaf.


