MaterialId is the ID of the material in the media asset library.', example='{"MaterialId":"6cf724c6ebfd4a59b5b3cec6f10d5ecf"}'),
  ownerId?: long(name='OwnerId'),
  regionId?: string(name='RegionId', description='The region ID.', example='cn-shanghai'),
