- **LowerLimit (integer):** Required. The lower limit of the frame rate. This must be an integer from 1 to 60 and less than the upper limit.', example='{"UpLimit":60,"LowerLimit":1}'),
  gop?: string(name='Gop', description='The Group of Pictures (GOP) size. The unit can be frame or second. Valid values:

